      "about": "Ash is a Director on Mastercard's Start Path team leading the Agentic Commerce and Services program, where he helps drive startup partnerships focused on the future of agentic commerce, AI-driven services, payments, identity, trust, and secure transaction infrastructure.Prior to Mastercard, Ash was Senior Director and Head of AI Partnerships at Insight Partners, a global software investment firm with over $95B in assets under management. At Insight, he worked closely with portfolio companies, strategic partners, and global enterprises to drive AI adoption, shape enterprise strategy, and support founders scaling category-defining software companies.Previously, Ash served as Chief of Staff to the CEO at Arena.im, a generative AI startup backed by leading venture capital firms. Earlier in his career, he was an Innovation Manager at Plug and Play Ventures and OneValley, where he helped build and scale corporate venture capital and corporate innovation programs. Ash also co-founded BioVirtua, a healthcare analytics startup recognized by NASA iTech and Startupbootcamp.",
